{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14774","headline":"斅颜鲁公送挺贇归翠微寺 · 卢纶","name":"斅颜鲁公送挺贇归翠微寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"挺贇惠学该儒释，袖有颜徐真草迹。\n一斋三请纪行诗，诮我垂鞭弄鸣镝。\n寺悬金榜半山隅，石路荒凉松树枯。\n虎迹印雪大如斗，闰月暮天过得无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14774.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14774","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}